{
 "blocks": [
  {
   "id": "block_113e7",
   "start": 70631,
   "lines": [
    "    Your dreams of the most",
    " fantastic vacation resort in",
    "the galaxy can now be realized.",
    " You turn the Kiwi towards the",
    "familiar Galactic Trading Post.",
    "        Press Any Key ^"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "block_115c2",
   "start": 71106,
   "lines": [
    "        Later that day...",
    "Mylo finally got enough to buy",
    "   his very own solar system,",
    " which he planned to make into",
    "       a vacation resort.",
    "The inner planets would be for",
    "swimmers and tanning, the outer",
    "planets would have ski resorts,",
    "and the middle planets all the",
    "   lodging and tourist shops.",
    " Mylo docks and boards Mr. Rip",
    "  Eweoff@s ship at the solar",
    "system, ready to sign the Deed.",
    "         Press Any Key ^"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "block_1232c",
   "start": 74540,
   "lines": [
    "   A Terrible Second Later...",
    " Mylo barely escapes with his",
    "life as the star he just bought",
    " erupts into a fiery supernova.",
    " The Millennium Kiwi rocks and",
    " tumbles as shock waves pummel",
    "        Mylo senseless.",
    "        \"What a bummer.\"",
    "   Mylo speeds away from the",
    " blazing inferno realizing he@s",
    "        blundered again.",
    "         Press Any Key ^"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "block_1268c",
   "start": 75404,
   "lines": [
    "       Two Weeks Later...",
    "Barely recovered, Mylo returns",
    " to the spot where he used to",
    "own a solor system.  All that@s",
    " left marking the location is",
    "a big, stupid cloud of colorful",
    "         vapor and dust.",
    "  \"Rats, I buy a solor system",
    "and I get stuck with a nebula.\"",
    "  Suddenly Mylo has the first",
    "  real brainstorm of his life!",
    "         Press Any Key ^"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "block_12cde",
   "start": 77022,
   "lines": [
    "     Mylo Burger is Born...",
    " Finally, one of Mylo@s ideas",
    "        has paid off!",
    "   Ever since he opened Mylo",
    "    Burger, overlooking the ",
    "  brilliantly colorful nebula,",
    " his burger stand has been the",
    " hottest hangout in the galaxy.",
    "  Now he@s even thinking about",
    " franchises--but first he must",
    "    wait for other stars to",
    "            explode!",
    "         Press Any Key ^"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "block_13063",
   "start": 77923,
   "lines": [
    "         A Happy Mylo...",
    "  In the meantime, Mylo will",
    "   relax and count his cash",
    "     until his next great",
    "   adventure takes him into",
    "      the vast unknown of",
    "            space...",
    " ...the final frontier.  These",
    " are the continuing voyages of",
    "  Mylo Steamwitz.  To boldly",
    "  blunder where no adventurer",
    " has trekked before.  To seek",
    " new treasures and profits...",
    "          The End...^"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "block_13409",
   "start": 78857,
   "lines": [
    "      CONGRATULATIONS!!!!",
    "You have successfully completed",
    " the Crystal Caves series, and",
    "   made Mylo rich and famous.",
    "Now you have a chance to replay",
    "  the games and get the best",
    "score you can. The best ways to",
    "  increase you score include",
    " finishing each level without",
    "loosing a heart.  Shooting all",
    "   the eggs and grabbing the",
    " \"BONUS\" letters, and getting",
    "    all the treasure chests.",
    "     Thank you for playing!"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "block_137cf",
   "start": 79823,
   "lines": [
    " SHIP@S LOG - STARDATE 2121.93",
    " -----------------------------",
    "Personal Entry - Record Mode On: ",
    "Forget the farming business, I@ve",
    "had enough!  Fortunately, I saw a",
    "program on Galactic Cable Vision",
    "that changed my life!",
    "Mr. Rip Eweoff was selling his",
    "technique to buy real estate",
    "with no money down.  Finally,",
    "I@d seen the light!",
    "         Press Any Key ^"
